\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Extended Ground Truth Overlap demonstrating the system's high recall (Matches) and massive capacity for novel entity discovery (Gen). Diagram radii are proportional to entity volume, adjusted slightly for text readability.}}{38}{figure.3.2}%
